{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "parknova-gateway-mobile-e2e",
    "name": "ParkNova Gateway + Mobile Consumer E2E",
    "description": "Full consumer flow through API Gateway (auth + mobile /client/**).\n\n## Gate check-in/out (important)\nProduction path: Enforcer Flutter app \u2192 REST gate check/confirm \u2192 offstreet rules \u2192 Kafka session/capacity/payment events.\nConsumer Flutter never calls check-in/out. See docs/ENFORCER-KAFKA-CHECKIN-CHECKOUT.md.\nFolder 6 ANPR requests are COMPAT/TEST only (simulate gate until Enforcer+Kafka ships).\n\n## Run order (Collection Runner)\n1. Health\n2. Auth \u2014 Register \u2192 Login\n3. Profile \u2014 Bootstrap \u2192 Me \u2192 Update \u2192 Support\n4. Lookups\n5. Vehicles \u2014 create saves vehicleId\n6. Garages \u2014 list may set garageId\n7. Happy path parking \u2014 Prepare \u2192 (compat ANPR Check-In) \u2192 Active \u2192 Check-Out/End \u2192 Pay\n8. History / notifications\n9. Logout\n\n## Prerequisites\n- Gateway :8080\n- Mobile service :8081 (routed via gateway)\n- Offstreet service :8090 (garages/products)\n- Keycloak realm parknova\n- Set serviceSecret to match mobile SERVICE_TO_SERVICE_SECRET\n",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
